# Caddyfile: Caddy 2 documentation: The Caddyfile, directives; requirements/languages/caddyfile.md
name     caddyfile caddy
keyword  reverse_proxy file_server root encode header redir respond tls log route handle handle_path
keyword  rewrite try_files basicauth import php_fastcgi uri templates
builtin  gzip zstd on off
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ` `
sigil    @    : meta
operators  {}*
